# Cloudflare Pages: serve the SPA shell for client-side routes.
# A catch-all (`/* /index.html 200`) is rejected as an infinite loop, and `/* / 200`
# would also swallow /assets, so routes are listed explicitly. Any other unknown path
# falls back to index.html via Pages' built-in SPA mode (no top-level 404.html) and
# shows the in-app 404 page.
/hire       /  200
/offlane    /  200
/offloud    /  200
/work/*     /  200
